msgid "Bounded Channels"
msgstr ""

#: src/concurrency/channels/bounded.md:8
msgid ""
"With bounded (synchronous) channels, [`send()`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/"
"std/sync/mpsc/struct.SyncSender.html#method.send) can block the current "
"thread:"
msgstr ""

